Hi All,

The Marvell Mobile Hotspot (micro-AP) feature has been added to "mwifiex" driver for Marvell 802.11n chipset SD8787.

The driver is available at:

  git://git.marvell.com/mwifiex.git
  http://git.marvell.com/?p=mwifiex.git;a=summary

The corresponding firmware image is available at:

  git://git.marvell.com/mwifiex-firmware.git
  http://git.marvell.com/?p=mwifiex-firmware.git;a=summary


The mwifiex driver has been rebased against tag "master-2010-11-18" on wireless-testing.git tree.


